NOT INCLUDED: each user supplies their own
- Music and sound effects (assets/audio/bgm, assets/audio/sfx). None are in this repository. Download your own,
  for example from the YouTube Audio Library, and follow each track's licence and attribution terms
  (Video Studio writes the track name into metadata.txt for the description).
- Generated character packs (assets/characters/<name>/ images). Only pack.json and contact_sheet.jpg of the
  example character are included. Each user generates their own pack with tools/make_character_pack.py from a
  character file in docs/characters/.
- AI models. setup.sh downloads them from their publishers; they are not part of this repository and keep their
  own licences.

THE STERLING CHARACTER
"Sterling" (the grey-and-white cat presenter in a navy blazer: docs/characters/sterling.md, its contact sheet and
the example frames in docs/images/) is the visual identity of the author's YouTube channel. They are included as
an example of what the pipeline makes. Please don't publish videos as Sterling or with his look; build your own
character (miso, biscuit, nova, or one you write).

